    "unknown": {
      "reentrant": true,
      "because": "It formats a string out of the hop it was handed and emits it. It reads nothing, writes nothing and executes nothing, so there is no state for a concurrent request to reach. Declared explicitly although it is not a subject: a declaration with a hole cannot catch a swap that quietly turns a parallel round sequential, and the occupant nobody declared is the one whose serialisation surprises the caller."
    }
